# Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct vLLM Deployment

## Overview

This guide explains how to run Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct with vLLM using GPU 1 with 8-bit FP8 quantization.

## Hardware

- **GPU**: 1 x NVIDIA L40 (46GB)
- **Tensor Parallel**: 1

## Quantization

- **Method**: FP8 (8-bit floating point)
- **Benefits**: Reduces memory footprint while maintaining model quality

## Quick Start

### Start Server

```bash
cd /data/lch/Models/Modelscope/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct
bash start_vllm.sh
```

### Stop Server

```bash
pkill -f "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct"
```

### API Usage

**Chat Completions API:**
```bash
curl http://localhost:1285/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct",
    "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello, how are you?"}],
    "max_tokens": 512
  }'
```

**With image URL:**
```bash
curl http://localhost:1285/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct",
    "messages": [
      {"role": "user", "content": [
        {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "https://example.com/image.jpg"}},
        {"type": "text", "text": "Describe this image"}
      ]}
    ],
    "max_tokens": 512
  }'
```

**With local image:**
```bash
curl http://localhost:1285/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct",
    "messages": [
      {"role": "user", "content": [
        {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "file:///path/to/image.jpg"}},
        {"type": "text", "text": "What is in this image?"}
      ]}
    ],
    "max_tokens": 512
  }'
```

**Python Client:**
```python
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(
    api_key="EMPTY",
    base_url="http://localhost:1285/v1"
)

response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct",
    messages=[
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": [
                {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "file:///path/to/image.jpg"}},
                {"type": "text", "text": "What is in this image?"}
            ]
        }
    ],
    max_tokens=512
)
print(response.choices[0].message.content)
```

